{"text": "At last Jemima said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tomorrow I am going to sit on my eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will bring some corn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So I will not need. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To leave my nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Madam, before you start sitting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Let us have a dinner party. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the gentleman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Please bring some herbs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the farm garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To make an omelette. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bring sage, thyme, mint and parsley. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And two onions as well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima was a simple duck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And even sage and onions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Did not worry her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She picked herbs in the garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And took two onions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the kitchen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Kep, the wise collie dog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Met her on her way out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What are you doing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With those onions, Jemima. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima told him the whole story. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And Kep listened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his head on one side. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he trotted to the village. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To find two fox hound puppies.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", "m", "o", "r", "r", "o", "w", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "g", "o", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "i", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "m", "y", " ", "e", "g", "g", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "b", "